      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAREFOOT ZEUS (8) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey having won two of three starts. Comes off a (19.83) win last time, scoring by 2.25 lengths in a Grade 6 over 366m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. HIDDEN DRAGON (2) is a talented type with an excellent strike rate at this journey. Jumped well when winning his last couple. Latest win recorded a handy 19.93 at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Has definite claims. BANANA LECLERC (4) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only a nose (20.11) behind True Hornet at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Can feature again. SUPREME COMANDER (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a P5 at this track over 366m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck.",
